{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017960/extras/ABOUT_600x225_EN.jpg?t=1727984140\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the Trials 2 demo, players are introduced to a slice of the game's expansive open world, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">offering a glimpse of the challenges and mysteries that await. You start with one of four unique abilities. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Test your creativity and challenge your intelligence by using available mechanics to manipulate objects in real time to open new pathways, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">and solve intricate puzzles. This demo teases a part of he full adventure, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">which has more abilities and puzzles that will come in the complete game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017960/extras/skills_600x225_EN.jpg?t=1727984140\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A variety of new skills, such as time manipulation, moving between worlds, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">teleportation and gravity manipulation.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3017960?t=1727984140","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3017960?t=1727984140","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017960/013d157617c3e1400b770f2f12763a5e38818636/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1727984140","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017960/013d157617c3e1400b770f2f12763a5e38818636/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1727984140","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"n